# A watch on one run, and a watch that asks for telemetry only. Each step call is one telemetry
# event. A fault-only watch still hears the end of its run.
load_plugin {plugin}
put_graph pass {graphs}/pass.json
watch 1 all telemetry
start pass
watch 2 1 fault
feed 1 in u32:3
step 1 2
next 1
watch 3 9 all
unwatch 1
next 1
stop 1 drain
next 2
